<title>SRI LANKA: Dankotuwa up on budget boost for exports.</title>
<headline>Dankotuwa up on budget boost for exports.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dankotuwa Porcelain Ltd rose 3.4 percent or one rupee to 30 rupees on 10,600 shares traded, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Last week's budget boost for exports has left retail investors scrambling for low-priced shares in the sector,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The calendar 1997 budget, presented to parliament last week, offers tax and capital goods import duty waivers for exporters.</p>
<p>Dankotuwa Porcelain manufactures porcelain tableware, mainly for export.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
